{"kind":"stack","id":"shadows-patterns","title":"Shadows: finding patterns in size","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#073642","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Shadow"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-def","content":"A dark shape made when an object blocks light. The shadow is on the far side from the light."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"A torch is shone on a toy car. The torch moves closer to the car. What happens to the shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"It gets smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"It stays the same size","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"A torch moves further away from a toy car. What happens to the shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"It gets smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"It disappears","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-term","content":"Light source"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-def","content":"Something that gives out its own light, such as the sun or a torch."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which of these makes the shadow of a tree grow longer in the afternoon?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"The sun lowers in the sky","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"The tree grows taller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"The wind blows the leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"You are out at dusk with a lamp. Your shadow is very long. Which way do you go?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Walk towards the lamp","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Walk away from the lamp","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"As you walk closer to the lamp, your shadow shrinks. You smile at the pattern you found."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"As you walk away from the lamp, your shadow stretches longer and longer behind you."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"A ball is held closer to a wall lit by a lamp. What happens to its shadow on the wall?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"It gets smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"It turns a different colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"Well done: you finished the shadows quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"You found patterns in how shadows change size. Keep looking for patterns around you."}],"actions":[]}}
